ripple-audit-corpus/: the shared planted-fault corpus, vendored verbatim from
qbtrix/ripple-iui packages/core/src/core/__fixtures__/audit-corpus/ on branch
feat/cl-3 at 4b4f8c7 (pending merge to main). Each entry's expect.python is what
card_spec.strict_audit must report on the ripple profile; expect.core is ripple's
side and is not read here. tests/cloud/test_paw_bar_audit_corpus.py runs it.

Refresh with the manifest (same ripple commit when possible):
  rm -rf ee/pocketpaw_ee/paw_bar/ripple-audit-corpus
  cp -R <ripple>/packages/core/src/core/__fixtures__/audit-corpus \
    ee/pocketpaw_ee/paw_bar/ripple-audit-corpus
then update the branch and commit above.
